      "reason": "Reads local preferences and would be a legitimate bounded read, but it does not exist on the stable client this pack pins: stable 1.98.10 answers \"unknown subcommand: get\" while unstable 1.103.74 provides it. Admitting a documented-but-unreleased command would ship an operation that fails for every operator on stable. Revisit when a stable client carries it.",
